# Vekta Brand

Follow [DESIGN.md](mdc:DESIGN.md) for visual decisions. Tokens: `src/index.css`, `tailwind.config.ts`.

## Non-negotiables

- **Primary**: `#5B5CFF` → `bg-primary` / `text-primary` / `hsl(var(--primary))`
- **Success mint**: `#2EE6A6` → `bg-success` / brand green scale
- **App font**: Inter (`font-sans`). **Public/access**: Space Grotesk (`font-spaceGrotesk`)
- **Dark-first**: black / near-black shells; do not invent cream/serif brochure themes
- **Logos**: `/public/brand/` via `BrandLogo` or existing paths (`vekta-access-mark.png`, wordmark, etc.)

## Do

- Prefer semantic tokens over arbitrary hex
- Match the surface you are editing (app shell vs `/access` vs tryvekta)
- Reuse `src/components/ui/*` primitives

## Don't

- Drift primary to other purples/indigos
- Add generic Inter-on-white SaaS templates for marketing
- Hotlink third-party brand CDNs when `/brand/` has the asset
